  "purpose": "Mechanical semantic-and-work qualification of coarsest-to-finest reverse-level evaluation at fixed delta=1. Passing may authorize a separate labelled high-level sampler-default implementation while preserving walnutpie defaults, fingerprints, revision, and replay.",
